<view class="page">
  <view class="title">学校发帖权限</view>
  <view class="hint">{{regionName || '管理范围由当前真实授权决定'}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" aria-role="alert">{{error}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{status}}" class="hint">{{status}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{pending}}" class="card pending">
    <view class="card-title">原保存请求待确认</view>
    <view class="hint">{{pendingSummary}}</view>
    <view class="identifier">学校区域：{{pendingRegionId}}</view>
    <view class="identifier">请求：{{pendingRequestId}}</view>
    <view class="hint">关闭页面、返回或查询未记录都不代表取消。重试会保留原始内容、版本和请求标识；不会自动创建新请求。</view>
    <button bindtap="onRecover" disabled="{{busy || storageBlocked}}">查询原保存结果</button>
    <button bindtap="onRetry" disabled="{{busy || storageBlocked}}">查询并同键重试原请求</button>
    <button bindtap="onCancelPending" disabled="{{busy || storageBlocked}}">请求取消尚未提交的原保存</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{management === 'global'}}" class="card">
    <view class="card-title">明确选择目标学校</view>
    <input placeholder="搜索学校名称" maxlength="100" value="{{campusQuery}}" bindinput="onCampusQuery" disabled="{{busy || pending || storageBlocked}}" />
    <button bindtap="onSearchCampus" disabled="{{busy || pending || storageBlocked}}">搜索学校</button>
    <button wx:for="{{campuses}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onChooseCampus" disabled="{{busy || pending || storageBlocked || !item.isActive}}">{{item.fullName}}{{item.isActive ? '' : '（不可用）'}}</button>
  </view>
  <button bindtap="onRefresh" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || pending}}">重新读取当前配置</button>
  <view wx:if="{{loaded}}" class="card">
    <view class="card-title">来源状态：{{sourceLabel}}</view>
    <view class="hint">版本 {{revision}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{currentPolicySummary}}" class="hint">当前记录：{{currentPolicySummary}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{effectiveAt}}" class="hint">生效时间（UTC）：{{effectiveAt}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{expiryLabel}}" class="hint">当前有效期：{{expiryLabel}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{blocker}}" class="error">{{blocker}}</view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{form}}" class="card">
    <view class="card-title">未认证用户的发布例外</view>
    <view class="hint">仅针对已确认未认证的用户；身份或来源未知时仍不可用。两个开关分别控制帖子与评论。</view>
    <label class="switch-row"><text>允许未认证用户发帖</text><switch checked="{{form.unverifiedPostEnabled}}" data-field="unverifiedPostEnabled" bindchange="onSwitch" disabled="{{busy || pending || storageBlocked || !editable}}" /></label>
    <label class="switch-row"><text>允许未认证用户评论／回复</text><switch checked="{{form.unverifiedCommentEnabled}}" data-field="unverifiedCommentEnabled" bindchange="onSwitch" disabled="{{busy || pending || storageBlocked || !editable}}" /></label>
    <view class="field-title">允许未认证发帖的分类</view>
    <view class="hint">仅发帖开关开启时使用下列名单；不包含意见反馈和校园交易。</view>
    <checkbox-group bindchange="onCategories">
      <label wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="key" class="category"><checkbox value="{{item.key}}" checked="{{item.checked}}" disabled="{{busy || pending || storageBlocked || !editable}}" />{{item.label}}</label>
    </checkbox-group>
    <view class="field-title">有效期（必须明确选择）</view>
    <radio-group bindchange="onExpiryKind">
      <label class="expiry-option"><radio value="at" checked="{{form.expiryKind === 'at'}}" disabled="{{busy || pending || storageBlocked || !editable}}" />指定 UTC 到期时间</label>
      <label class="expiry-option"><radio value="policy_exempt" checked="{{form.expiryKind === 'policy_exempt'}}" disabled="{{busy || pending || storageBlocked || !editable}}" />政策豁免，不设到期时间</label>
    </radio-group>
    <input wx:if="{{form.expiryKind === 'at'}}" value="{{form.validUntil}}" bindinput="onValidUntil" placeholder="例如 2027-01-01T00:00:00Z" maxlength="40" disabled="{{busy || pending || storageBlocked || !editable}}" />
    <view class="hint">仅接受带 Z 的 ISO UTC 时间；不会按手机本地时区推断。已过期策略需要明确更新有效期后重新发布。</view>
    <button class="primary" bindtap="onSave" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || pending || storageBlocked || !editable}}">保存并发布此学校策略</button>
  </view>
  <view class="card rules">
    <view class="card-title">持续适用的发布要求</view>
    <view>未认证用户仅可实名发布，此要求不可修改。</view>
    <view>手机号验证与内容审核（Review）仍独立生效，本页不会跳过或放宽这些要求。</view>
    <view>此页不提供关联学校同步开关；存在同步或来源异常时只读。</view>
  </view>
</view>
